  "overview": "Not only your ships Idaten and Benten, but also the options Adon & Samson, and even the backgrounds, come at you with live-action impact! The \"trust system,\" in which the options' attacks change depending on how the player performs, is back.\n\n自機の韋駄天、弁天はもちろん、オプションのアドン＆サマソン、そして背景までも、実写の迫力で迫る！オプションの攻撃が、プレイヤーの働き次第で変化する「信頼度システム」健在。"
